advanced.description:
{Advanced Summon Boars}

Summons Boars to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Boars summoned is 50% greater than Basic Summon Boars.

expert.description:
{Expert Summon Boars}

Summons Boars to fight on your side during the battle.

Amount of Boars summoned is 100% greater than Basic Summon Boars.
